sequenceDiagram
    participant PP as Payment Processing
    participant BI as Biller Integration
    participant R as Reconciliation
    participant W as Wallet / Ledger
    participant A as Audit Log
    participant N as Notifications
    actor Sara as Customer

    alt biller refuses the payment
        BI-->>PP: Refused(reason)
        PP->>PP: SentToBiller -> Failed
    else Unknown resolved by re-query or callback
        BI-->>PP: Refused
        PP->>PP: Unknown -> Failed
    else Unknown resolved by settlement file
        R-->>PP: not listed in settlement file
        PP->>PP: Unknown -> Failed
    end
    Note over PP: An Unknown payment is never refunded directly.<br/>Only a Failed payment is refunded.
    PP->>W: release hold(total)
    W->>W: ledger: reverse hold entries
    W-->>PP: hold released, available balance restored
    PP->>PP: Failed -> Refunded
    PP->>A: who, when, why (money movement)
    PP->>N: payment failed and refunded
    N-->>Sara: SMS with clear reason
